#: ../../api.rst:69
msgid ""
"``JSON()``, ``String()``, ``XML()``, and ``Render`` check the request "
"type while the handler is built. It must be a struct, a pointer to a "
"struct, or a type that implements ``FromRequest``. Any other type panics "
"immediately:"
msgstr ""
"``JSON()``、``String()``、``XML()`` 和 ``Render`` 在构建处理器时检查请求类型。"
"请求类型必须是结构体、结构体指针，或实现了 ``FromRequest`` 的类型。"
"其它类型会立刻 panic："

#: ../../api.rst:77
msgid ""
"The panic happens when the handler is built, usually while the route is "
"registered, rather than on the first request. ``G`` itself only names the"
" handler; the check runs when that handler is turned into a "
"``HandlerFunc``."
msgstr ""
"panic 发生在构建处理器时，通常是注册路由的时候，而不是第一个请求到来时。"
"``G`` 本身只是标明处理器；检查发生在该处理器被转换成 ``HandlerFunc`` 时。"

