msgstr "从 HTTP cookies 中提取值。"

#: ../../api.rst:221
msgid "Empty and required values"
msgstr "空值与必填"

#: ../../api.rst:223
msgid ""
"As a struct field, ``FromQuery``, ``FromForm``, ``FromHeader``, and "
"``FromCookie`` treat a missing or empty value as the zero value of ``T``."
" Tag the field ``required:\"true\"`` to return "
"``extractor.ErrEmptyValue`` instead."
msgstr ""
"作为结构体字段时，``FromQuery``、``FromForm``、``FromHeader`` 和 "
"``FromCookie`` 把缺失或空字符串当作 ``T`` 的零值。"
"给字段加上 ``required:\"true\"`` 则会返回 ``extractor.ErrEmptyValue``。"

#: ../../api.rst:228
msgid ""
"``FromPath`` is always required. The ``required`` tag does not change "
"path parameters."
msgstr "``FromPath`` 始终必填。``required`` 标签不会改变路径参数的行为。"

#: ../../api.rst:231
msgid ""
"Calling ``FromRequest`` directly, outside struct-field binding, also "
"rejects an empty value."
msgstr "在结构体字段绑定之外直接调用 ``FromRequest`` 时，空值同样会被拒绝。"

#: ../../api.rst:243
msgid "Value Interface"
msgstr "Value 接口"

#: ../../api.rst:256
msgid ""
"``T`` is parsed from the raw request string. Predeclared types such as "
"``int`` and ``string`` are converted directly; defined types (``type "
"UserID int``) use the same underlying kind so they can also implement "
"``ValueNamer``."
msgstr ""
"``T`` 从原始请求字符串解析。``int``、``string`` 这类预声明类型会直接转换；"
"定义类型（``type UserID int``）按相同的底层种类转换，因此也可以实现 ``ValueNamer``。"

#: ../../api.rst:261
msgid ""
"When an extractor is a struct field, its request value name is resolved "
"from the first non-empty source in this order: ``hx`` tag, extractor-"
"specific tag (``path``, ``query``, ``header``, ``form``, or ``cookie``), "
"then the Go field name:"
msgstr ""
"提取器作为结构体字段时，请求值名称按以下顺序取第一个非空来源："
"``hx`` 标签、提取器自己的标签（``path``、``query``、``header``、``form`` 或 ``cookie``），"
"最后是 Go 字段名："

#: ../../api.rst:275
msgid "ValueNamer Interface"
msgstr "ValueNamer 接口"

#: ../../api.rst:283
msgid ""
"Optional interface for reusable named value types. Only defined types can"
" implement it (predeclared ``int`` and ``string`` cannot have methods). A"
" non-empty ``ValueName`` takes precedence over all struct-field metadata."
" Direct extraction outside a struct requires ``ValueName`` and otherwise "
"returns ``ErrValueNameRequired``."
msgstr ""
"供可复用命名值类型实现的可选接口。只有定义类型能实现它"
"（预声明的 ``int`` 和 ``string`` 不能有方法）。"
"非空的 ``ValueName`` 优先于所有结构体字段元数据。"
"在结构体之外直接提取时必须提供 ``ValueName``，否则返回 ``ErrValueNameRequired``。"

#: ../../api.rst:299
msgid ""
"``NamedValue`` combines ``Value`` and ``ValueNamer`` for generic code "
"that requires a value to provide its own name."
msgstr ""
"``NamedValue`` 组合了 ``Value`` 和 ``ValueNamer``，"
"供要求值自己提供名称的泛型代码使用。"

